Orca is a next-generation Agent Development Environment (ADE) designed
to orchestrate and manage fleets of AI coding agents (such as Claude Code,
Grok Bot, Codex, and others) concurrently in isolated Git worktrees.

Features:
- Parallel execution of autonomous coding agents
- Native terminal integration with pseudo-terminals
- Git worktree automation and isolation
- Integrated editor and diff view

WWW: https://github.com/stablyai/orca
